WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.380
An icy lane at dusk.

2
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.850
A horse slips, and its rider crashes down.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.010
A small governess helps him up.

4
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:13.560
He leans on her and growls: "necessity
compels me to make you useful."

5
00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.040
He's her master: rich,
proud, about twice her age.

6
00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:22.370
And he deceives her: he courts
another woman to make her jealous.

7
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.820
So why does the novel bring
these two back together?

8
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.630
In this mission, you'll
study that first meeting,

9
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.020
line by line.

10
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:34.260
And you'll find a great chestnut tree
that "had been struck by lightning in the

11
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.190
night".

12
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.380
Why would a novelist split a tree in two?

13
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.980
Your mission: work out why
the novel reunites them.
